# The endpoint in .env identifies a private host and stays out of the repository.
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
build/
dryrun.py
*.egg-info/

# OS and editor noise that must never be committed, even if present in the
# eval fixture directory.
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.pyc
*.pyo
*~

# evals/results/ is deliberately tracked: the reports are measurement data, and
# the ground-truth hash a report prints is only worth something if there is a
# commit it can be resolved against. Losing an overwritten report once was
# enough.